  "releaseNotes": "Additions:\nadd tests to reproduce isa and rocrate json import error #512\nexpose default .gitattributes contract equal to .gitignore #534\ncontinue reworking ArcTable according to change requests in #537\ncontinue reworking ArcTable according to change requests in #537\nsmall performance improvement to ArcTable.GetColumn\nextend and run performance tests\nadjust ArcTable json parsing according to changes in ArcTable structure\nupdate ArcTable compressed json parsing\nadd and run performance tests\nupdate default ArcTable json parsing\nheavily improve performance of ArcTable addRow and addColumn\nimprove performance of Annotation Table Read\nchange OntologyAnnotation TanInfo computation time\nimplement fillmissingcells\nadjust tests according to ArcTable rework\nfinish up first version of ArcTable rework in source code\nstart reworking ArcTable references\nfinish up first version of reworked ArcTable\nfinish up first version of ArcTableValues type\ncontinue reworking arcTable by adding ArcTableValues type\nStart working on ArcTable redesign :sparkles:\nAdd (more) tests for ArcInvestigation functionality\nAdd in-memory spreadsheet file for tests\nUpdate fromRows function for ArcInvestigation module\nimprove performance import to include preparation and repeated testing\nforce python dict usage in compressed json writing\nimprove LDContext Dictionary access speed\nchange ro-crate labprocess id generation to include study or assay name\nadd test against distinct ro-crate process ids for same table names\nDeletions:\nadd preliminary removeRowRange function\nBugfixes:\nvarious small fixes and comments according to PR #539 review\nfix processes with underscore names being incorrectly parsed back to Scaffold tables #512\ndatamap comment headers now contain \"Comment\" prefix #515\nfix scaffold reader assigning assay datamap to study\nsmall fixes to ArcTable according to PR comments\nsmall fix to ArcTable\nsmall fixes to ArcTable functions\nremove erase from ColumnRefValues to fix js and py\nfix final tests against dotnet for table rework\nfix some ArcTable tests\nfix arctable cell addition and retrieval according to tests\nsome fixes to ArcTable according to tests\nsmall fixes against tests for ArcTable rework\nsome fixes on ArcTable against tests",
